 "notes": [
  "Join key is dev.symbol_identity.key; the raw symbol and ISIN are carried in every row. 36 Persian/Arabic spelling pairs share a key; the 82 duplicate effective dates they produce are collapsed with the history symbol's own spelling as the primary witness.",
  "1468 symbols have no instruments row. They stay in the ledger as unresolved_no_instruments and INSUFFICIENT_EVIDENCE with SYMBOL_IDENTITY_MISMATCH in the blocker; they are not dropped. The 3 duplicate instruments keys are reported; 2 occur in the history universe and resolve through B1's ISIN-first choice.",
  "Official O1/O2 rows are positive witnesses only. No ingest-completeness proof exists in this round, so O1=0/O2=0 is never used as proof of no event. 33 no-step symbols carry 79 in-range O1 events and are flagged OFFICIAL_EVENT_WITHOUT_STEP, not promoted or failed.",
  "VERIFIED_NO_APPLICABLE_EVENT requires a resolved identity and a full R1 type0/type7 window with no factor changes. Only 36 of 951 pack symbols have a reference now and 0 no-step symbols have a full window, so the count is 0 until B11 reruns with the full capture.",
  "5188 history_validity rows are unverified with factor_steps=0. None carries a pack step; the zero is accurate as a step count but is not a no-event claim. The raw-symbol validity table cannot see the 36 alias spellings: 550 raw alias steps (82 duplicate dates + 468 applicable) sit outside its count, so its unverified total is 808 vs the pack's 1358.",
  "Halted means the latest instrument_state title contains توقف/معلق/ممنوع and the last bar is older than the latest session. A bar on the latest session wins over an outdated state. Up to 21 sessions behind is recent; more is stale.",
  "BLOCKED_SOURCE is 0: no step carried it and identity failure is classified as SYMBOL_IDENTITY_MISMATCH / INSUFFICIENT_EVIDENCE per the design's identity rule.",
  "The six final statuses are read verbatim from dev/phase49_status_rules.json symbol_status_precedence."
